<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady, trade slow.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices steady, trade slow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. cash diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were steady in very quiet trade, cash sources said.</p>
<p>Conditions are likely to remain slow until after Wednesday's New Year holiday, they said.</p>
<p>				Dlrs/short ton     Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla	   177-180			unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf     188-190			unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf	     225			  unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
